Of course, upon the request of our brother...

130
00:19:17,000 --> 00:19:19,000
Mihemed...
 
Mohammed...

131
00:19:19,000 --> 00:19:23,000
Vê gundî kes t'mol... t'hedê dijmin ne westiya.
 
In this village no one in the house... got tired of the
enemy's challenge.

132
00:19:23,000 --> 00:19:25,000
Teben mezin e, wa gotin ne.
 
Of course it is big, so they said, right.

133
00:19:25,000 --> 00:19:45,000
Xelkî gundê Gawanda ne.
 
They are the people of the village of Gawanda.

134
00:19:45,000 --> 00:19:50,000
Nûka ciwê gundo dixwazin, mal ne miheddet bin, hema nûka
nateka bin vê gundî.
 
Now they want the places of the villages, the houses
shouldn't be limited, just now they are not defined in this
village.

135
00:19:50,000 --> 00:19:52,000
Nûka bes dibê filan gundî teswîr ke.
 
Now he just says film such-and-such village.

136
00:19:52,000 --> 00:19:55,000
Ya em nizanin em kîderê teswîr kin, kîderê teswîr nekin.
 
Oh we don't know where to film, where not to film.

137
00:19:55,000 --> 00:19:58,000
Welleh wisa wek vederê pirr e, mezin e.
 
By God, it's like out there, it's full, it's big.

138
00:19:58,000 --> 00:20:00,000
Mezin e.
 
It is big.

139
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:06,000
Ne mumkin e meriv... sê saet çara vegire, ne mumkin e b...
 
It is impossible for one... to take three, four hours,
impossible to...

140
00:20:06,000 --> 00:20:13,000
Noko wek birakî min Mehemed molo... mero mihebet kir, em
dogru çûyîn ber mol patê.
 
Now like my brother Mehemed the Mullah... he chatted with
us, we went straight towards the house.

141
00:20:13,000 --> 00:20:16,000
Ma cîranê gundê Sewran d... horet...
 
We are neighbors of the village of Sawran...
[unintelligible]...

142
00:20:16,000 --> 00:20:36,000
Bi me ra no... bêle bikin, bi telîqa de bêle bikin, hûn
dibên bes filan gundî, hûn dixwazin.
 
Now with us... participate, participate in the comments, you
say only such and such village, whatever you want.

143
00:20:46,000 --> 00:21:06,000
Maşalla cografî pir xweş e ha.
 
Mashallah, the geography is very beautiful.

144
00:21:07,000 --> 00:21:10,000
Ahvalno rêk pir xirab e wela.
 
Friends, the road is very bad, honestly.

145
00:21:10,000 --> 00:21:12,000
Xweşiya xwe tê de re.
 
It has its own beauty.

146
00:21:12,000 --> 00:21:31,000
Bine, çi gund be.
 
Look, whatever village it is.

147
00:21:31,000 --> 00:21:37,000
Ahvalno ji me ra bin, her yek pênc tealîqa yozmîş kin, her
yek pênca ha.
 
Friends, be with us, everyone write five comments, everyone
fifty, okay.

148
00:21:37,000 --> 00:21:39,000
Na pênc bin na meşe.
 
No, if it's five, it won't work.

149
00:21:39,000 --> 00:21:45,000
Her yek pênc tealîqa, û kiftika dilê xwe da yozmîş kin, heke
çiqas gund wara teswîr kim wuro.
 
Everyone five comments, and write the joy of your heart, if
the village is so nice, I will film it for you there.

150
00:21:45,000 --> 00:22:05,000
Gundê wekî... heke derxim.
 
A village like... if I bring it out.

151
00:22:49,000 --> 00:23:09,000
Rêka darê zorat e.
 
The road to the tree is a slope.

152
00:23:26,000 --> 00:23:32,000
Maşalla wela mentiqê me Efrîn pir mezin e.
 
Mashallah, honestly our Afrin region is very large.

153
00:23:32,000 --> 00:23:38,000
Arê, miletê me hîşta mentiqê me pir xweş e, be'almen
cografya...
 
Yes, our people, our region is still very beautiful, really
the geography...

154
00:23:38,000 --> 00:23:42,000
Em xelkê mentiqê ne, em rêkê gunda, gunda nizanin.
 
We are people of the region, [yet] we don't know the roads
of the villages, the villages.

155
00:23:42,000 --> 00:23:49,000
Ne eyb e ku pir mezin e, gerek meriv zane be gundê me, kê
derman cêl kê de keve.
 
It's not a shame that it's very big, one needs to know our
villages, where the remedy... where it falls.

156
00:23:49,000 --> 00:23:52,000
Ox, xelkê bînyet a ra dike wadiye...
 
Oh, people are building foundations in the valley...

157
00:23:52,000 --> 00:23:57,000
Na be, hîşta Efrîn... tişt heye. Ox, Efrîn bi selamet e, ox,
ox, ox.
 
It won't be, Afrin still... has things. Oh, Afrin is safe,
oh, oh, oh.

158
00:23:57,000 --> 00:24:00,000
Mêrek... weş e ku dexm ra dike.
 
A man... it's good that he is working hard.

159
00:24:00,000 --> 00:24:02,000
Xwedê rizqê bide.
 
May God grant sustenance.

160
00:24:02,000 --> 00:24:18,000
Gundî bişînin, Xwedê mihefeze ke.
 
Send it to the villager, may God protect him.

161
00:24:18,000 --> 00:24:30,000
Ev rêka darê zorat e.
 
This is the road to the tree, it's a slope.

162
00:24:30,000 --> 00:24:34,000
Taba xelkê vê darê fehle jî çinîne, ev polîm le bigir.
 
Of course, the people here have also harvested the crops,
catch this film for me.

163
00:24:34,000 --> 00:24:45,000
Wadiye fehle çinîne?
 
Is it so, have they harvested the crops?

164
00:24:45,000 --> 00:24:49,000
Erê ehvalno, teb'en me hinte... birakî me Mehemed kir,
Ehmed.
 
Yes friends, of course just now we... made our brother
Mehemed, Ahmed [correcting the name].

165
00:24:49,000 --> 00:24:54,000
Em îna kol cem ziyaretê ne, hevo ziyareta o, kevn e, ê hecer
jî li piş ê ye.
 
We are now near the shrine, this is an old shrine, the stone
one is behind it.

166
00:24:54,000 --> 00:24:59,000
Me go em silavekê li şebaban bidin. Merheba ştora xalo?
 
We said let's give a greeting to the guys. Hello, how are
you uncle?

167
00:24:59,000 --> 00:25:01,000
Merheba. Çawa hal û demê we?
 
Hello. How is your condition and time?

168
00:25:01,000 --> 00:25:02,000
Wela elhemdila.
 
Well, praise be to God.

169
00:25:02,000 --> 00:25:05,000
Xalo, vî gundî... vêr dibên kîderê vî gundî?
 
Uncle, this village... what do they call this village here?

170
00:25:05,000 --> 00:25:07,000
Ev gundê Dudê ye.
 
This is Dudê village.

171
00:25:07,000 --> 00:25:08,000
Dudê? Û yê boy an o?
 
Dudê? And the one over there?

172
00:25:08,000 --> 00:25:10,000
Haho Gawanda ye.
 
That one is Gawanda.

173
00:25:10,000 --> 00:25:17,000
Gawanda, ha, walîm wa lê bigir Gawanda.
 
Gawanda, ha, catch Gawanda on film for me.

174
00:25:17,000 --> 00:25:18,000
Ew Gawanda ye.
 
That is Gawanda.

175
00:25:18,000 --> 00:25:19,000
Hevo Gawanda ye?
 
Is this Gawanda?

176
00:25:19,000 --> 00:25:20,000
Erê.
 
Yes.

177
00:25:20,000 --> 00:25:21,000
Û hev jî gundê Dudê ye.
 
And this is Dudê village.

178
00:25:21,000 --> 00:25:22,000
Hev jî gundê Dudê ye.
 
This is also Dudê village.

179
00:25:22,000 --> 00:25:25,000
Arê ehvalno, me çûxta gund wara teswîr kirin.
 
Yes friends, we have filmed both villages for you.

180
00:25:25,000 --> 00:25:27,000
Gawanda, gundê Dudê.
 
Gawanda, Dudê village.

181
00:25:27,000 --> 00:25:31,000
Maşalla, me pir gunda kirine.
 
Mashallah, we have done many villages.

182
00:25:31,000 --> 00:25:33,000
Xalo ez seh dikim cem we mêwe pir nin?
 
Uncle, I hear you don't have much fruit here?

183
00:25:33,000 --> 00:25:34,000
Ee.
 
Yes.

184
00:25:34,000 --> 00:25:38,000
Yanê rez... rez bi şeklê om rez... vî derê, vê mentiqê pir
rezê xû pir e.
 
I mean vineyards... vineyards in general vineyards... here,
this region has many vineyards.

185
00:25:38,000 --> 00:25:39,000
Mûsim e noko.
 
It's the season now.

186
00:25:39,000 --> 00:25:40,000
Mûsimê rez e ne?
 
It's the vineyard season, right?

187
00:25:40,000 --> 00:25:41,000
Mûsimê kîlo ye.
 
It's the kilo season [harvesting by weight].

188
00:25:41,000 --> 00:25:43,000
Hereket heye xalo, çilû?
 
Is there movement [business], uncle, how is it?

189
00:25:43,000 --> 00:25:45,000
Hereket hemdilla heye, ee.
 
There is movement praise be to God, yes.

190
00:25:45,000 --> 00:25:48,000
E rinde, buhaye biçiderê kîlo noko?
 
That's good, what is the price per kilo now?

191
00:25:48,000 --> 00:25:51,000
Wela, sê dolar a, çar dolar a.
 
Well, three dollars, four dollars.

192
00:25:51,000 --> 00:25:52,000
Wela?
 
Really?

193
00:25:52,000 --> 00:25:54,000
Berê vî çerayî distî dikirin tirk?
 
Did the Turks buy it like this before?

194
00:25:54,000 --> 00:25:56,000
Na bi dolar e.
 
No, it's in dollars.

195
00:25:56,000 --> 00:25:57,000
Dolar e?
 
It's dollars?

196
00:25:57,000 --> 00:26:00,000
Ahvalno, dibê bi sê dolar e, çar dolar a e noko xolî min
dibê.
 
Friends, he says it's three dollars, four dollars now, my
uncle says.

197
00:26:00,000 --> 00:26:05,000
Xalo vê mentiqê biçite nivîs kirin vê... vê gindano. Tu
dizanî wekî?
 
Uncle, this region should be written about... these
villages. Do you know how?

198
00:26:05,000 --> 00:26:06,000
We çi yanê?
 
Like what, you mean?

199
00:26:06,000 --> 00:26:10,000
Yanê bichin me'rûf e, bichin tênos kirin vê malbat nav vê
gund nav.
 
I mean let them be famous, let the names of these families
and villages be recorded.

200
00:26:10,000 --> 00:26:11,000
De çida tênos kirin?
 
How are they recorded?

201
00:26:11,000 --> 00:26:12,000
Wela...
 
Well...

202
00:26:12,000 --> 00:26:15,000
Seqafet têda, mesela...
 
There is culture in it, for example...

203
00:26:15,000 --> 00:26:17,000
Gundê mezin e gundê me.
 
Our village is a big village.

204
00:26:17,000 --> 00:26:21,000
Ewa, te vî gundî mezin bî, vî gundî wa biçite naskirin
mesela.
 
Yes, since this village is big, this village should be known
for example.

205
00:26:21,000 --> 00:26:22,000
Gundê Dudê ye.
 
It is Dudê village.

206
00:26:22,000 --> 00:26:23,000
Gundê Dudê?
 
Dudê village?

207
00:26:23,000 --> 00:26:24,000
Ee.
 
Yes.

208
00:26:24,000 --> 00:26:25,000
Ser serê min, ser çavê min.
 
Upon my head, upon my eyes [You are welcome/respected].

209
00:26:25,000 --> 00:26:30,000
Sax be, ser çava, sax be.
 
Be healthy, upon my eyes, be healthy.

210
00:26:30,000 --> 00:26:32,000
Erê ahvalno, teb'en amkê pir gundo wara teswîr kin.
 
Yes friends, of course we will film many villages for you.

211
00:26:32,000 --> 00:26:34,000
Bira gundê ser çorsed sal ra ye.
 
This tree is over four hundred years old.

212
00:26:34,000 --> 00:26:35,000
Ee.
 
Yes.

213
00:26:35,000 --> 00:26:37,000
Xolî min, avolî min lê bigir.
 
My uncle, catch this for me on film.

214
00:26:37,000 --> 00:26:40,000
Dibê ev daro, emrê xo teqrîben çorsed sal e.
 
He says this tree, its age is approximately four hundred
years.

215
00:26:40,000 --> 00:26:42,000
Darek pir mezin e, kevnar e.
 
It is a very big tree, ancient.

216
00:26:42,000 --> 00:26:43,000
Belê.
 
Yes.

217
00:26:43,000 --> 00:26:45,000
Ev darê hîn mezin bû bes qut kirin.
 
This tree was even bigger but they cut it.

218
00:26:45,000 --> 00:26:49,000
Qut kirin ne, jê perçe qut kirin. Ez zanim wawa hişîn dibe.
 
They cut it, right, they cut pieces from it. I know it grows
green like that.

219
00:26:49,000 --> 00:26:53,000
Milet hat ew kirin, çîçkê... nehiştin qut kirin... hê qut
kirin bes nehiştin.
 
People came and did that, the branches... they didn't leave
them, they cut them... they just cut them and didn't leave
them.

220
00:26:53,000 --> 00:26:57,000
Wela pir darê hebûn qut kiribûn, bes e biftile, şîn dide wek
berê.
 
Honestly there were many trees they had cut, but this one
twists, it gives green [grows] like before.

221
00:26:57,000 --> 00:26:58,000
Na ye, hecer biye, maşalla yê rind biye.
 
No, it has become stone [strong], mashallah it has become
good.

222
00:26:58,000 --> 00:27:00,000
Ee, erê.
 
Yes, yes.

223
00:27:00,000 --> 00:27:03,000
Saetê te xweş, Xwedê Pêxember ji te razî be, serkeftin be ji
we ra.
 
Health to your hours, may God and the Prophet be pleased
with you, success to you.

224
00:27:03,000 --> 00:27:07,000
Sax be, we xweş.
 
Be healthy, you too.

225
00:27:07,000 --> 00:27:12,000
Erê ahvalno, teb'en ez pirs dikim ji xaletî, dibê ev o
ziyareta kevn e.
 
Yes friends, of course I am asking the uncle, he says this
is an old shrine.

226
00:27:12,000 --> 00:27:14,000
Bere vî derê girtirbe bûn.
 
Before, this place was all graves.

227
00:27:14,000 --> 00:27:16,000
Vira girtirbe bûn.
 
Here was all graves.

228
00:27:16,000 --> 00:27:17,000
Bes neho ji vî derê...
 
But now from here...

229
00:27:17,000 --> 00:27:22,000
Ra kirine, pêşê, vîr dibên ziyareta Hecer, li vê hemberê me
ye.
 
They removed them, forward, they call this the Shrine of
Hecer, it is opposite us.

230
00:27:22,000 --> 00:27:27,000
Teb'en hev xirfê jî, avolî min li vê xirfê bigir, hev xirfê
jî...
 
Of course this room too, catch this room for me on film,
this room too...

231
00:27:27,000 --> 00:27:29,000
Dibê e şehîd e... şehîd kî ye?
 
He says it is a martyr... who is the martyr?

232
00:27:29,000 --> 00:27:33,000
Waa... ew... berê vê wî de, dûr gundê ew hebî.
 
Well... that... before this and that, far away that village
existed.

233
00:27:33,000 --> 00:27:35,000
Bihara bî, hej hebîn.
 
It was spring, there was Hajj/pilgrimage.

234
00:27:35,000 --> 00:27:38,000
Dahatin, dazî pîda girêdidan, digotin...
 
They used to come, tie threads to it, saying...

235
00:27:38,000 --> 00:27:40,000
Hevo şehîd e, Şehîd Siltan e.
 
This is a martyr, Martyr Sultan.

236
00:27:40,000 --> 00:27:42,000
Navê xwa Siltan bî.
 
His name was Sultan.

237
00:27:42,000 --> 00:27:43,000
Aaa.
 
Ah.

238
00:27:43,000 --> 00:27:46,000
Şehîd Siltan, vî derê digotin Şehîd Siltan bîra?
 
Martyr Sultan, did they call this place Martyr Sultan,
brother?

239
00:27:46,000 --> 00:27:49,000
Wa digotin vî derê. Da wek em zanin...
 
That's what they said about this place. As we know...

240
00:27:49,000 --> 00:27:50,000
Erê, erê.
 
Yes, yes.

241
00:27:50,000 --> 00:27:51,000
Berê wa digotin me ra...
 
Before they told us...

242
00:27:51,000 --> 00:27:56,000
Şûre di ber de, gû digrin. E kevno, kal û pîrê me wa
digotin, şûre xwa gû girtine.
 
Sword in hand, holding. The old ones, our elderly said so,
he held his sword.

243
00:27:56,000 --> 00:28:00,000
Şehîd Siltan, vî derê. Teb'en vî derê gi tirbe bîn.
 
Martyr Sultan, this place. Of course this place was all
graves.

244
00:28:00,000 --> 00:28:01,000
Erê.
 
Yes.

245
00:28:01,000 --> 00:28:02,000
Xwedê rehma xwe li giyo ke.
 
May God have mercy on all souls.

246
00:28:02,000 --> 00:28:22,000
Fatiha bixwînin û dua bikin.
 
Read Fatiha and pray.

247
00:28:44,000 --> 00:28:49,000
Erê birayê me Ehmed, teb'en me honta dilî ta kir, vêra dibên
Ziyareta Şêx Mûs.
 
Yes our brother Ahmed, of course we just mentioned, they
call this the Shrine of Sheikh Mus.

248
00:28:49,000 --> 00:28:52,000
Hevo hawa.
 
This is it.

249
00:28:52,000 --> 00:28:58,000
Teb'en em hatin jî, xolî min viro tirbê qeba dike, saetê wî
jî xweş, Xwedê Pêxember jî razî be.
 
Of course we came too, my uncle here is digging a grave,
health to his hours too, may God and the Prophet be pleased.

250
00:28:58,000 --> 00:29:05,000
Û rehmê li miriyê we bin, û rehmê li umetê Mehemed tevda be,
û li miriyê gundiyan jî be.
 
And mercy be upon your dead, and mercy be upon the entire
Ummah of Muhammad, and upon the dead of the villagers too.

251
00:29:05,000 --> 00:29:12,000
Teb'en hevo o hecer a, ziyareta hecer a hevo.
 
Of course this is the stone one, the stone shrine is this
one.

252
00:29:12,000 --> 00:29:24,000
Mentiqa pir xweş e vî derê wela.
 
Honestly, the region is very beautiful here.

253
00:29:24,000 --> 00:29:28,000
Teb'en em jî wek merkezê Efrîn...
 
Of course we too, as the center of Afrin...

254
00:29:28,000 --> 00:29:30,000
Ji merkezê Şêxmeqsûd Haleb...
 
From the center of Sheikh Maqsood, Aleppo...

255
00:29:30,000 --> 00:29:34,000
Cihê gul miriyê xwe li vir, teb'en carna bi sal dibin Haleb.
 
The place of our dead is here, of course sometimes they are
in Aleppo for years.

256
00:29:34,000 --> 00:29:36,000
Em cenazê gundê kamil tînin li viro.
 
We bring the bodies of the whole village here.

257
00:29:36,000 --> 00:29:40,000
Û teb'en tab ke, evro daro, kolanê daro wasil...
 
And of course whatever, today... until the streets...

258
00:29:40,000 --> 00:29:44,000
Em gund bi gund... ta wasil dibin vêra, em tînin ba dişîrin
gundî gundiyo...
 
We [go] village by village... until they arrive here, we
bring them and send/bury them in the village of the
villagers...

259
00:29:44,000 --> 00:29:45,000
Yan... xwa bi l...
 
Or... by...

260
00:29:45,000 --> 00:29:50,000
Merkezê me Haleb Şêxmeqsûd gundê Penû tagû, em li wir hazir
in.
 
Our center is Aleppo Sheikh Maqsood, village of Penû
whatever, we are ready there.

261
00:29:50,000 --> 00:29:54,000
Yê ku daxwazeke tirbê xwe qeba ke, em jêre qeba jî dikin.
 
Whoever requests to dig their grave, we will dig it for them
too.

262
00:29:54,000 --> 00:29:56,000
Em li virin, kînin cenazê gundiyan jî tînin viro.
 
We are here, whoever they are, we bring the bodies of the
villagers here too.

263
00:29:56,000 --> 00:29:58,000
Û miletê xwe jî, Şehba yê jî em tînin. Ji her der ke.
 
And our people too, from Shahba too we bring them. From
everywhere.

264
00:29:58,000 --> 00:30:00,000
Yê ku daxwaz bike tirbê xwe qeba ke, em jêre qeba jî dikin.
 
Whoever requests to dig their grave, we will dig it for them
too.

265
00:30:00,000 --> 00:30:03,000
Amade ne ji bo her xizmetê meletê xwe re. Saeta te xweş.
 
We are ready for any service for our people. Health to you.

266
00:30:03,000 --> 00:30:05,000
Haleb, Şêx Meqsûd. Em hatine vêderê...
 
Aleppo, Sheikh Maqsoud. We have come here...

267
00:30:05,000 --> 00:30:10,000
Roj Haleb xwelî mhatî, vêderê ji Şêx Meqsûd va hatî.
 
[Name/Reference] came here, came here from Sheikh Maqsoud.

268
00:30:10,000 --> 00:30:14,000
Tab'an miriyê we li Haleb, li Şehba, li kû derê hene...
 
Naturally, your dead in Aleppo, in Shahba, wherever they
are...

269
00:30:14,000 --> 00:30:19,000
Xwelî min... mirîyê hatine vêderê, Xwedê rehma xwe li ê
miriya bike, tînin vê mantiqê.
 
My poor self... the dead that have come here, may God have
mercy on those dead, they bring them to this area.

270
00:30:19,000 --> 00:30:24,000
Têkşin mantiqê daxwazê, li wir dikin tirbe, va dişrin, tirba
jî qebat dikin.
 
They enter the requested area, there they make graves, wash
them [the bodies], and cover the graves.

271
00:30:24,000 --> 00:30:28,000
Tayib, xalo, rûpelê we hene? Yanî melet wara tawasul ke,
reqemê we, telefonê?
 
Okay, uncle, do you have a page? So the people can contact
you, your number, telephone?

272
00:30:28,000 --> 00:30:29,000
Heye, erê.
 
There is, yes.

273
00:30:29,000 --> 00:30:36,000
Temam. Emê reqemê xalo dînin ser rûpelê, wînê kaxeza
